{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537660/extras/693cd43789717d48aadb62d038d1fd35.avif?t=1752770221\" width=556 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A new adventure in Meiji Spa</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akane and Bot are tasked with guarding a resort\u2014a peaceful hot spring retreat nestled in the snowy mountains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a relaxing and fun-filled hot spring adventure. Explore the Meiji Spa, interact with fun characters, and discover hidden events. Complete unexpected side quests while chilling in the hot springs and maybe even save the world ..!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander the hot spring resort and discover hidden interactions that could trigger secret events!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Combat</strong> \u2013 Enjoy classic turn-based battles that are fun but not grindy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humorous Story</strong> \u2013 Each character interaction is filled with charm and humor that\u2019ll make you smile!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Side Quests</strong> \u2013 Some quests unfold in surprising ways and could even impact the town\u2019s future!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uique Art Style</strong> \u2013 Beautifully combines smooth pixel animation with retro comic aesthetics for a one-of-a-kind look.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537660?t=1752770221","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537660/02ccdebbda249e0be3fd3dc2459171f89a499591/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752770221","capsule_image